OL,3,GNEWSAGleneagles Hotel buys Scotland's
OL,4,A'ghost' golf course
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Gleneagles Hotel has bought a
OL,7,Fneighbouring "ghost" golf resort, which
OL,8,Fhas been shrouded in secrecy for years,
OL,9,Ffor an undisclosed sum.
OL,11,FThe gWest course in Blackford, Perth
OL,12,Fand Kinross, was completed in 2009 but
OL,13,Fnever officially opened to the public
OL,14,Fand very few people are thought to have
OL,15,Fplayed it.
OL,17,FThe Gleneagles Hotel said the purchase
OL,18,Foffered an opportunity to "extend our
OL,19,Fstewardship of this remarkable
OL,20,Flandscape that has always been integral
OL,21,Fto the spirit of the hotel."
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
