OL,3,GNEWSAGleneagles Hotel buys Scotland's
OL,4,A'ghost' golf course
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe course was previously owned by
OL,7,FMahdi al-Tajir, the owner of mineral
OL,8,Fwater firm Highland Spring who was
OL,9,Fpreviously Scotland's richest man, and
OL,10,Fhis family.
